ex03_ArSiO Example 3: 1 keV Ar on 20 A SiO2 on Si (static)
# obligatory control parameters
cdat 1 1.0 0
geom 200.0 100 0.0
atda Ar Si O
irra 1 1000.0 0.0 1.0
# optional control parameters
thrd 1
pspr 10000
coll 1 0
damg 0.0
elst 3
exst 1 0.9999 3 0
fout 100 100 100
outp
edep
outl rang incd scat sput
